+                    "Only an OPEN or PENDING claim is waived, not a " + claim.getStatus() + " one");
+        }
+        if (claim.isWaived()) {
+            throw new ResponseStatusException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT, "The claim's late charge is already waived");
